  {
    "title": "假眼睛的骗术：从猛虎到海鸟，它都管用",
    "seo_summary": "眼睛，在自然界是强大的威慑信号。本文揭秘印度林业部门如何用“假面具”吓退孟加拉虎，以及英国科学家如何用“巨眼浮标”大幅减少海鸟误入渔网的“兼捕”现象。这不仅是动物行为学的奇妙案例，更展示了简单视觉方案",
    "url": "https://nautil.us/floating-scarecrow-demonstrates-the-enduring-power-of-eyes-in-the-natural-world-1285493",
    "cover": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/a92c551a7664cd77.jpg",
    "wechat_html": "<section style='margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#fff;'><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzXgUR7FJnf11qGIo8nmKt6RxibXrb5s4RFb9UZ9UOHQy7fqQyI377Licw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'><section style='padding:0;'><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">1980年代的印度，一场看不见的危机正在蔓延。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">孟加拉虎，这种丛林之王，不再正面搏杀。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它们学会了从背后偷袭渔民、采蜜人和伐木工人。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">每次突袭都意味着死亡，当地人生活在恐惧之中。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你肯定会想，该如何对付这种狡猾的杀手？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">答案，却出乎所有人意料。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">不是猎枪，也不是陷阱，而是一张戴在脑后的“假面具”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这张面具上，只有一双眼睛。</p><img peitu='true' src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/a92c551a7664cd77.jpg' style='width:100%;display:block;margin:30px 0;'><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">一个学生受到昆虫“假眼斑”的启发，提出了这个点子。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他认为，如果老虎以为有人在看着它，就不会从背后攻击。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">印度林业部门采纳了办法，发放数千张廉价橡胶面具。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">奇迹发生了：戴着面具的人，真的变得安全了。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这听起来荒谬，却实实在在救了命。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它证明了，被“看见”的压力，对动物行为有强大影响。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">从猛虎到海鸟：无声的威慑</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">几十年过去，同样的原理，如今被用来解决另一个生态难题。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">在欧洲海岸，每年有近10万只潜鸟，包括海鸠、刀嘴海雀。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它们常常误入渔民的刺网。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">刺网是一种垂直立在水中的渔网，专门靠卡住鱼鳃捕鱼。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这些饥饿的海鸟，为了捕食被困的鱼，自己也卡在网中。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">最终，它们溺水而亡。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这种无辜的牺牲，渔业上称之为“兼捕”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">尤其冬季，渔网孔径变小，兼捕问题更加严重。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你可能觉得，这是无法避免的损失。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但科学家们不这么看。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">巨眼浮标：简单却高效的解决方案</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">英国埃克塞特大学的研究团队，开始寻找解决之道。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们测试了两种视觉威慑方案。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">第一种是“驱鸟风筝”。农民常利用它来吓走偷吃庄稼的鸟。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">测试发现，风筝在自身百米范围内有效，能减少兼捕。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但它的作用范围有限。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">团队还自己设计了一种更低成本的装置。那是一个漂浮的“巨眼浮标”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它只是一个浮在水面的装置。上面画着两只巨大的卡通眼睛。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你甚至能想象它在水面无声地“凝视”着。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">经过两年测试，巨眼浮标效果惊人。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它的威慑范围远超风筝。这能大幅度减少被困海鸟的数量。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">研究员汤姆·霍顿说，简单实际的威慑装置很有效。它能大幅减少海鸟兼捕。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它比你想象的更有效。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">识别关键心理按钮，制造最强威慑</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">从丛林猛虎到海洋海鸟，这背后是同一个残酷真相。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">被“眼睛”盯着，行为就会改变。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这种古老的生物本能，至今依然奏效。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它启示你，有时解决复杂难题，并不需要高科技。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">一个简单的视觉信号，足以改变局面。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">审视你的问题，看看哪里能用上“眼睛”的魔力。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">识别关键心理按钮。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">用简单方式，制造最强威慑。</p><section style='margin:45px 0 20px 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;'><section style='font-size:13px;color:#999;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase;'>TAGS</section><section><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>动物行为</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>生态保护</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>创新方案</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>心理学</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>渔业</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>视觉设计</span></section></section></section><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzk57DCmhVC16o9ILH0Tn1YPEiarfLRRQSVFN2mJdeYibGnBPialPIzvojw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'></section>",
